{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>And Elohim said, etc.</b> This too was only for that moment, in the manner we explained regarding the creation of the water creatures (Genesis 1:20). The reason He was not required to tell them to be fruitful is that He implanted in them the instinct to reproduce and they bore young of themselves; rather, He commanded them that species should not intermix with another that is not its kind — this is what He said <b>לְמִינָהּ</b>, etc."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T18:56:54.248412376Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}